{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47262","headline":"留观中诗二首 一 · 吴子来","name":"留观中诗二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"终日草堂间，清风常往还。\n耳无尘事扰，心有翫云闲。\n对酒惟思月，餐松不厌山。\n时时吟内景，自合驻童颜。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吴子来","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_47262.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47262","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}